#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering-helicopter-setup.rst:6
#: 4f7b148dc4f4478297336e4cf2d40ba3 a77924b1514343a48878e7713fb9ba4a
#: d970ce55b18849248331c9dff0ae5930
msgid "Traditional Helicopter Notch Filter Setup"
msgstr "传统直升机陷波滤波器设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering-helicopter-setup.rst:8
#: 8b02582c4ba04510b624d1f6cb4b335f 935850975352433490b3dfc675192740
#: c818ff307adc4db6b954e0e726644e6e
msgid ""
"Perform the :ref:`Determination of Noise Frequencies <common-imu-notch-"
"filtering-flight-and-post-flight-analysis>` analysis explained in the "
"Throttle based setup section. From the FFT you should see spikes at the "
"frequency of your rotor speed in Hz (RPM/60) and harmonics of that "
"frequency.  In the image below, the rotor speed is 25hz.  Note that the next"
" two biggest spikes occur at 50 Hz and 100 Hz."
msgstr ""
"对于使用外部调速器控制旋翼转速的直升机，通常使用静态陷波（:ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE<common-imu-notch-"
"filtering-flight-and-post-flight-analysis>` = 0）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering-helicopter-setup.rst:14
#: 4b0ce18f862742d8aeb472db37669538 4fd3032e930346fbbdb2c8987405a90e
#: f7097a54a46747cbb119806e5e357b41
msgid ""
"In most cases, only the rotor speed frequency, the second harmonic and 4th "
"harmonic. Use the dynamic harmonic notch setup below if you have an ESC or "
"RPM sensor for rotor speed. Otherwise use the static harmonic notch setup "
"below."
msgstr "将 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ<INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` 设置为旋翼在正常悬停转速下产生的基频振动（Hz）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering-helicopter-setup.rst:16
#: 0d7ee14528f2418f9aa6be40fa3345dd 482652d503534459a36e4773cfa14fce
#: 906cc18b0bdc4754a3ba8236500258d3
msgid ""
"There will most likely be another spike at the tail rotor frequency at the "
"main rotor frequency X the tail rotor speed up gear ratio. This is will "
"usually be attenuated by the harmonic notch setup since its often a close to"
" a harmonic of the main rotor frequency."
msgstr ""
"对于 ArduPilot 头部转速调速器，使用 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE<INS_HNTCH_MODE>` = 2 或 5（RPM "
"传感器模式）以实现动态跟踪。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering-helicopter-setup.rst:19
#: 96ad21ba6f8041018043057b80f4f252 cf1484d1ac04451c8229a1136eb0e3a8
#: f562c287c003469e8d36b6a47266a49c
msgid "Static Harmonic Notch"
msgstr ""
"HeadSpeed 参数（``H_RSC_SETPOINT``）设定了旋翼目标转速（单位：RPM）。陷波中心频率（Hz）= 旋翼转速（RPM）× 桨叶数"
" ÷ 60。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering-helicopter-setup.rst:21
#: 064f60082ef044dcb4cc9cf9a81ed3a5 0ec70b3526e84162bfd243006bdbe13e
#: ea5cf9ed56c642009e61a075db7bff5d
msgid ""
"If there is not an RPM sensor, the harmonic notch reference frequency will "
"be set and will not change.  If the rotor speed in RPM based on settings of "
"the ESC governor or the internal RSC governor is known, then that value "
"converted to Hz would be used to set the harmonic notch reference frequency."
"  So here are the settings for the static harmonic notch.  Note that the "
"parameter :ref:`INS_HNTCH_REF <INS_HNTCH_REF>` is set to zero for the static"
" harmonic notch."
msgstr ""
"如果没有转速传感器，谐波陷波参考频率将是固定不变的。若已知 ESC 调速器或内部 RSC 调速器设定的旋翼转速（RPM），把该值换算为 Hz "
"即可用来设置谐波陷波参考频率。静态谐波陷波的设置如下。注意静态谐波陷波要把参数 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_REF <INS_HNTCH_REF>`"
" 设为零。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering-helicopter-setup.rst:23
#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering-helicopter-setup.rst:36
#: 25dab25bbfef41ad867e6db751e252b4 4400398d0ddb45acb732d09d63aaa762
#: 5cd37929dcf245408b6e798bd9350f3f 92ca0ebcd4224e1f9bbdf2f2f55cc634
#: 92cafbb279fb447382800b5d4c3a924a a441445cede04c8cafaa9d91775fe352
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_ENABLE <INS_HNTCH_ENABLE>` = 1 to enable the harmonic "
"notch"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_ENABLE <INS_HNTCH_ENABLE>` = 1，启用谐波陷波"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering-helicopter-setup.rst:24
#: 24875830255c4d12aa90ce724c35f80b 3501464179fd4eeaa71c004a0485bf9e
#: ef40da90f590498ab42b10de4ffbee62
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_REF <INS_HNTCH_REF>` = 0 to set the harmonic notch "
"reference value for the static harmonic notch"
msgstr ""
"对于尾桨产生的高频振动，可使用第二组谐波陷波滤波器（:ref:`INS_HNTC2_ENABLE<INS_HNTCH_REF>` = 1）进行处理。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering-helicopter-setup.rst:25
#: 124aa240d5dd4185b81248ae4b34c27d 5139a2cc0c4645d29f5a40bbfa084493
#: 83b25fb6dd9646b683dbd03864130b18
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ <INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` = Rotor Speed in Hz to set the "
"harmonic notch reference frequency"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ <INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` = 旋翼转速（Hz），设定谐波陷波参考频率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering-helicopter-setup.rst:26
#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering-helicopter-setup.rst:41
#: 08c097e4973c4784b6f0a6ab74597e19 5d27bbb9a1d144a1ad2c8ca9fd189574
#: 7da86c5ed3a340f396290775b7959c78 ba9a7e5e84e94092831364a4e957b94f
#: dd85663093c74100a31eaaf16738b813 f2f57fa7a5cf487e8ac19f30a5c0007b
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_BW <INS_HNTCH_BW>` = 10 to set the harmonic notch "
"bandwidth"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_BW <INS_HNTCH_BW>` = 10，设定谐波陷波带宽"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering-helicopter-setup.rst:27
#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering-helicopter-setup.rst:42
#: 1d4d00ab07f9421d9169146c791d1b04 2e6f88b23b024a60a137efb510a7eb12
#: 3e045746cb164064a47282627f00f7c6 4d30bdb7eb754e77bca79ca0aef77181
#: 4e6543bd89b34cdf9e626d076a7c841f 80dc2efc6ec1451aa137db08c282370f
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_HMNCS <INS_HNTCH_HMNCS>` = 11 to set 1st, 2nd, and 4th "
"harmonics"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_HMNCS <INS_HNTCH_HMNCS>` = 11，选定第 1、2、4 次谐波"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering-helicopter-setup.rst:30
#: 030f2b0d1564423791fed71c7d2e60b5 532a6d3dd73346cba6c747084afbd92f
#: 6fd74d81508f4ba7a50a4c4256a5d821
msgid "Dynamic Harmonic Notch"
msgstr ""
"如果使用多桨叶设计（3桨或4桨），需要覆盖相应的谐波频率，并适当调整 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_HMNCS<INS_HNTCH_HMNCS>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering-helicopter-setup.rst:32
#: 12d5af510003462e8a13f56117a45664 878234f8a11e4b26b110be2e2f1e6e2e
#: f66e6a1f36d84dc6a708fd61cc8649c7
msgid ""
"If there is an RPM sensor set up on RPM 1, the harmonic notch reference "
"frequency can be set dynamically using the RPM 1 sensor "
"(:ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>` = 2).  The harmonic notch reference "
"frequency parameter, :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ <INS_HNTCH_FREQ>`, is used to "
"indicate the lowest rotor speed for which the RPM sensor should be used to "
"dynamically set the harmonic notch reference frequency.  It is recommended "
"that this be set to half of the governed rotor speed."
msgstr ""
"如果 RPM 1 上设置了转速传感器，谐波陷波参考频率可由 RPM 1 传感器动态设定（:ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE "
"<INS_HNTCH_MODE>` = 2）。谐波陷波参考频率参数 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ <INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` "
"用于指定使用 RPM 传感器动态设定参考频率的最低旋翼转速，建议设为额定（调速器控制的）旋翼转速的一半。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering-helicopter-setup.rst:34
#: 43a2c5a9754c485c9798366e08f38f9f 59363e2dc4db49558725fb7f5c458c3a
#: d7e2a13d6ba8496bae090788f0adfbf5
msgid ""
"First, ensure that the RPM 1 data is valid and scaled to the rotor speed "
"using the :ref:`RPM1_SCALING<RPM1_SCALING>` parameter.  Then set the "
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_REF <INS_HNTCH_REF>` parameter to 1 which will enable the "
"dynamic setting of the harmonic notch.  The harmonic notch feature will "
"automatically scale the RPM sensor data to Hz.  If for some reason the RPM "
"sensor can not be set to the rotor speed, then the :ref:`INS_HNTCH_REF "
"<INS_HNTCH_REF>` parameter can be used to scale the RPM Sensor data.  For "
"example, let's say the RPM sensor was measuring engine RPM which was geared "
"at 10 to 1 to the rotor RPM.  Then the :ref:`INS_HNTCH_REF <INS_HNTCH_REF>` "
"parameter would be set to 0.1 to scale the RPM sensor data for the rotor "
"RPM.  So here are the settings for the dynamic harmonic notch."
msgstr ""
"首先，确认 RPM 1 数据有效，并已通过 :ref:`RPM1_SCALING<RPM1_SCALING>` 参数换算为旋翼转速。然后把 "
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_REF <INS_HNTCH_REF>` 参数设为 1，即可启用谐波陷波的动态设置。谐波陷波功能会自动把 RPM "
"传感器数据换算为 Hz。如果 RPM 传感器因故无法直接测得旋翼转速，可用 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_REF <INS_HNTCH_REF>` "
"参数对 RPM 传感器数据进行换算。例如，假设 RPM 传感器测的是发动机转速，而发动机与旋翼的传动比为 10:1，那么把 "
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_REF <INS_HNTCH_REF>` 参数设为 0.1 即可把 RPM "
"传感器数据换算为旋翼转速。动态谐波陷波的设置如下。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering-helicopter-setup.rst:37
#: 2d468a2471014241a4d5f4546ad56671 33c181b19aa84e4b832134f9a06a0771
#: 7748990d1522454d8ff8cbcea3f3b927
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_REF <INS_HNTCH_REF>` = 1 to set the harmonic notch "
"reference value to the RPM sensor data. RPM sensor data is automatically "
"scaled to Hz."
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_REF <INS_HNTCH_REF>` = 1，把谐波陷波参考值设为 RPM 传感器数据。RPM "
"传感器数据会自动换算为 Hz。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering-helicopter-setup.rst:39
#: 7dc7229449c14c6ebf07c41ff9d2acd2 d5bfeff871f246bbada87abd5378f3be
#: d8a9ebbe3a2745289e0f52364c02d10b
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ <INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` = half of governed Rotor Speed in"
" Hz to set the lower bound of the dynamic harmonic notch reference "
"frequency."
msgstr "完整的传统直升机陷波滤波器设置指南，请参阅 :ref:`直升机陷波设置<INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` 页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering-helicopter-setup.rst:45
#: 160c6071715b42698556fa2f4a87cde5 5af3ac97443b4f239922e760fb138dc6
#: 70efa7f9af614050b3932f5c236685c9
msgid "Checking Harmonic Notch Effectiveness"
msgstr ""
"同时请参阅 :ref:`common-rpm-based-notch` 了解基于 RPM 传感器的动态陷波设置详情，以及 :ref:`common-"
"throttle-based-notch` 了解基于油门的陷波设置方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-notch-filtering-helicopter-setup.rst:47
#: 24c5b78d2ba04c03abb7a09e27f414e1 508bfd9826ba42bd87bdac7de69eb796
#: 6ca81527507148dbadd2c33a5acb0b67
msgid ""
"After setting up the harmonic notch, the effect on the control signal data "
"can be checked using the instructions for :ref:`common-imu-notch-filtering-"
"post-configuration-flight-and-post-flight-analysis`."
msgstr ""
"设置好谐波陷波之后，可按照 :ref:`common-imu-notch-filtering-post-configuration-flight-"
"and-post-flight-analysis` 中的说明检查其对控制信号数据的影响。"
